OL,3,GNEWSA'Vomit inducing' smell back to
OL,4,Aplague town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "foul smell" which is causing people
OL,7,Fto be sick and others to consider
OL,8,Fmoving home has returned to a town two
OL,9,Fyears after a previous outbreak.
OL,11,FPeople living around Newton Aycliffe in
OL,12,FCounty Durham said the smell is
OL,13,Fbecoming "more frequent" with some
OL,14,Ftaking trips away just to escape the
OL,15,Fodour.
OL,17,FIn 2024 the Environment Agency (EA),
OL,18,Fwhich is investigating the latest
OL,19,Fissue, identified Aycliffe Quarry as
OL,20,Fthe source of foul smells but it does
OL,21,Fnot believe the new stench is a
OL,22,Frecurrence of the previous pong.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
