OL,3,GNEWSA'Vomit inducing' smell back to
OL,4,Aplague town
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local Labour MP Alan Strickland
OL,7,Fsaid the problem appears to be coming
OL,8,Ffrom in or near Aycliffe Business Park
OL,9,Fwhere one worker described the smell as
OL,10,F"ridiculous".
